flowchart TB
    accTitle: Where the data goes
    accDescr: Everything stays in the browser on this computer. The popup and the switcher ask the service worker, which keeps a token per account, a password only when one is remembered, the settings of the button, the time of the last renewal, whether Autodarts turned every account away in it, and until when a new account is being added in chrome.storage.local. It moves a session into the Autodarts page and reads the outgoing one out of it only through content.js, the one script that reads or writes the session in the page's localStorage. To renew a token, sign in with a password or end a session, it talks to api.autodarts.com over HTTPS, the same service the Autodarts page itself uses. The popup and the switcher show each player's picture from the address Autodarts gives for it. Nothing else goes anywhere: no server of the developer, no analytics; Help and Report a problem only open a page in a new tab.

    subgraph computer ["The browser on this computer"]
        direction TB
        ui["The popup<br>and the switcher<br>pages of the extension"]
        worker["The service worker<br>switches, renews, signs in"]
        storage[("chrome.storage.local<br>a token per account,<br>a password if remembered,<br>the button's settings,<br>the last renewal,<br>the window for<br>a new account")]
        page["The Autodarts page<br>its session in<br>localStorage, touched<br>only by content.js"]
        storage <--> worker
        ui -- "a tap" --> worker
        worker <-- "a session,<br>in and out" --> page
    end
    api["api.autodarts.com<br>renews a token, signs in,<br>ends a session"]
    nobody["Nobody else<br>no server of the developer,<br>no analytics; only the<br>players' pictures load from<br>where Autodarts keeps them"]

    worker -- "HTTPS" --> api
    page --> api
    api ~~~ nobody

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef failed fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class ui,page person
    class worker,storage bot
    class api done
    class nobody failed
